06. dist-asc without orderFrom — 400 BadRequestData
===================================================
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 189

{
  "detail": "orderBy dist-asc/dist-desc requires the orderFrom parameter",
  "status": 400,
  "title": "Invalid orderBy",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/BadRequestData"
}



07. dist-asc with a non-Point orderGeometry — 501 Not Implemented
=================================================================
HTTP/1.1 501 Not Implemented
Date: REGEX(.*)
Content-Type: application/json
Content-Length: 216

{
  "detail": "sort by distance is only supported for a Point orderGeometry (got 'LineString')",
  "status": 501,
  "title": "Not Implemented",
  "type": "https://uri.etsi.org/ngsi-ld/errors/OperationNotSupported"
}



--TEARDOWN--
swBrokerStop
swDbDrop
